{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12706","headline":"题孟中丞茅阁 · 元结","name":"题孟中丞茅阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小山爲郡城，随水能萦纡。\n亭亭最高处，今是西南隅。\n杉大老犹在，苍苍数十株。\n垂阴满城上，枝叶何扶疎。\n乃知四海中，遗事谁谓无。\n及观茅阁成，始觉形胜殊。\n凭轩望熊湘，云榭连苍梧。\n天下正炎热，此然冰雪俱。\n客有在中坐，颂歌复何如。\n公欲举遗材，如此佳木欤。\n公方庇苍生，又如斯阁乎。\n请达谣颂声，愿公且踟蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}